note Event horizon (tier III): ratios 1, 2, 3, 5, 4, 7 — every chord tone including the seventh, which no pyretic spell has. The cloud
note locks a harmonic-seventh chord, ten voices, drenched; the sub is at full mass; the riser loops at the rim, swelling with the orb's reach.
